cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Onera in your research, please cite it using the metadata below, along with MNE-Python and YASA."
title: "Onera: Interactive Sleep EEG Analysis Pipeline"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lupu
    given-names: Alexandru
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-3320-7467"
    affiliation: "University of Fribourg, Switzerland"
abstract: >-
  Onera is an interactive Python (Marimo) pipeline for sleep EEG and
  polysomnography analysis. It characterizes brain activity in the minutes
  preceding targeted awakenings (e.g., serial awakening and dream report
  paradigms) and provides whole-night sleep architecture summaries.
keywords:
  - sleep
  - EEG
  - polysomnography
  - dreaming
  - serial awakenings
  - spectral analysis
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/alexandru-lupu-sci/Onera"
version: "1.0.0"
